# Production Environment Variables
# These should be set in Replit Secrets, not stored in source code

# Google Cloud Storage Configuration
# Set these values in production environment secrets:
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_BUCKET=thermopac_storage
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_CREDENTIALS=[JSON service account key]

# SECURITY NOTE: 
# Never store actual credentials in this file.
# Use Replit Secrets or environment variables in production.